             r = loadNativeObj_POSIX(line+match[2].rm_so, errmsg);
+            /* The #2615 linker-script workaround assumes that the
+               absolute paths found in the script are valid on the host.
+               That assumption breaks with a relocated cross toolchain
+               (e.g. conda-forge's sysroot'd binutils): the GROUP entry
+               points into a foreign filesystem root that does not
